# Chandam Project - Windsurf Rules

You are working on **Chandam (ఛందం)**, a Telugu/Sanskrit/Kannada poetry meter analysis system.
379 Telugu rules, 554 tested examples, 96.09% accuracy. Website: https://chandamu.github.io/

## Hard Rules

1. **NEVER modify** `Chandam.Core/`, `Chandam.Rules/`, `Chandam.Util/`, `Chandam.Indic/`, or `Chandam.Samples/`. These contain undocumented domain knowledge built over 10+ years.

2. **Preserve Telugu text** — no forced English translations, maintain Unicode, test with real Telugu text.

3. **KISS** — no future-proofing, small focused functions, mandatory parameters, solve current problem only.

## Stack
- C# / .NET 8.0, Blazor WASM, xUnit, Docker
- MCP (Model Context Protocol) for AI agent integration
- YAML (YamlDotNet) preferred for Telugu text config

## Architecture

```
Core (READ-ONLY):  Util -> Indic -> Core (no Rules/Samples dependency)
API:               Chandam.API (service layer) -> Chandam.API.WebApi (REST)
MCP:               Chandam.MCP.Tools -> Stdio + Http servers
Web:               Chandam.Wasm (Blazor WebAssembly)
```

Rules loaded at runtime via JSON/YAML — not compiled in.

## Build & Test
```bash
dotnet build Chandam.sln
dotnet test Chandam.MCP.Tests              # 13 tests
dotnet test Chandam.API.IntegrationTests   # 554 examples
dotnet publish Chandam.Wasm -c Release -p:ExcludeYaml=true
```

## Coding Standards
- N-Layer: Interface -> Service -> Data Access + Contracts
- No business logic in data access
- Constants in constants folder; secrets in `.env`
- Commit: `[Phase#] Category: Description`

## File Placement
- Docs: `Docs/plans/` and `Docs/execution/`
- Scripts: `Docs/Scripts/`
- Rules: `Chandam.Config/Rules/`
- Baselines: `Chandam.Config/Baselines/`

## Domain Terms
Chandam=Meter, Padyam=Verse, Gana=Foot, Yati=Caesura, Prasa=Rhyme, Vruttam=Meter type
